{"duration_api_ms":175216,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6a3538a6-3d1a-4636-af47-d5b50689be7e","total_cost_usd":0.930845,"usage":{"input_tokens":50,"cache_creation_input_tokens":45923,"cache_read_input_tokens":1599705,"output_tokens":12166,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1700},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":45923,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":962,"cache_read_input_tokens":80069,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1231,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1231},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":50,"outputTokens":12166,"cacheReadInputTokens":1599705,"cacheCreationInputTokens":45923,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.930845,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1700,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":45923,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":25,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"PKT-0093 is done: PKT-0091's fix works. After the change, every remote-typing batch on user B takes the incremental font path, and the full font scan no longer runs at all while typing.\n\n| Variant | B busy ms | font collection ms | batches on incremental path |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| before (sdkjs main 9cea536) | 3 737 | 271 | — (136 full scans) |\n| PKT-0091 (fork `theseus` 88df302) | 3 459 | 0.5 | **143 / 143**, 0 full scans |\n\n- **Batches:** each batch now carries only the paragraph run (`ParaRun`). The description change that used to force the full scan (`CTableId`) is skipped. There are 143 batches rather than 30 because the save step that collects fonts runs 46–49 times per 30 markers.\n- **Gain:** about 270 ms of font collection per 30 changes on the 100-page file, roughly twice the ~140 ms the packet expected. B's busy time drops about 7 %. This VM was busier than in earlier runs (the before figure was 237 ms in PKT-0089 and 140 ms in PKT-0071), so the gain grows with load.\n\nAll five acceptance commands pass. `differential/sdkjs-common.sh` failed once with a Playwright timeout, then passed on an unchanged rerun.\n\n**Decisions**\n- I compared only two variants. The PKT-0091 build already includes PKT-0087's `TableId_Add` branch, and the before build has neither; PKT-0089 had already measured PKT-0066 and PKT-0087 alone. The baseline section says which builds include what.\n- Both bundles are the differential oracle's cached builds rather than new ones.\n- The measurement script stays in the scratchpad (`/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-euro-office-server-theseus-worktrees-PKT-0093/6a3538a6-3d1a-4636-af47-d5b50689be7e/scratchpad/ab.cjs`), because the target only allows `baseline.md`.\n- The factory's resume commit in `external/sdkjs` had recorded the forms addon folder (`.theseus-addons/sdkjs-forms`) as a git link. That is outside the scope, so I removed it in a separate commit (261086b).\n\n**Not done:** the profiler did not separate `ParaRun.Get_AllFontNames`, so I report all `*AllFontNames` self time instead. The style case is not measured; it falls back to the full scan by design.\n\n**Lesson for the Atlas:** remote typing sends one description change plus one `ParaRun` per batch. With PKT-0091, almost none of B's font-collection cost is left.\n\nThe baseline section, executor log and friction line are committed, and `theseus validate` reports 0 errors.","ttft_ms":11518,"type":"result","duration_ms":1002157,"uuid":"2959345a-073e-4f67-8e75-87756735ae6e","ttft_stream_ms":10471,"time_to_request_ms":305,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":7,"system_prompt":140,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":5,"input_attachments":28,"input_hooks":4,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":12,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":10,"init_frame_send":5,"engine_pickup":2,"loop_entry":5,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":3,"request_announcements":17,"query_setup":8,"auto_mode_context_wait":11,"model_gates":2,"tool_schema_build":28,"message_normalization":3,"client_creation":3,"request_build":9},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":62,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":197,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":209,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":139,"process_rss_mib_result":205,"process_anon_mib_result":144,"process_peak_rss_mib":243,"process_cpu_ms_turn":17154,"process_wall_ms_turn":1002157,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":1537,"process_wall_ms_streaming":97409,"main_stream_count":25,"main_stream_event_count":1761,"main_stream_chunk_count":1247,"process_turn_states":{"main_stream":{"cpu_ms":1537,"wall_ms":97409,"entries":25},"tool":{"cpu_ms":13889,"wall_ms":826021,"entries":24},"first_event_wait":{"cpu_ms":924,"wall_ms":77495,"entries":25},"before_first_request":{"cpu_ms":197,"wall_ms":305,"entries":1},"between_requests":{"cpu_ms":592,"wall_ms":889,"entries":24},"after_last_request":{"cpu_ms":15,"wall_ms":38,"entries":1}},"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"artifact_opening_prefetch","slowest_producer_ms":11,"cpu_ms":28,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":0,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":12,"ambient_wait_ms":10,"render_ms":2,"producers":41,"token_counts":0},"tool_schema_build_detail":{"betas_ms":0,"waits_ms":1,"placement_ms":2,"render_ms":25,"a